.TH "cube-by-mooz" "6" "2026-11-13" "Cube User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
cube-by-mooz - run Cube, a 4k intro released by MooZ
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
cube-by-mooz
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cube is a 4k intro written by MooZ for the 2004 Linux 4k compo.
A grid of small cubes is lit by three metaballs that drift through it:
each cube grows with the field around it.
In rhythm, the picture switches between two blur effects made with
textures: a soft glow and a radial zoom.
.PP
The intro opens a 640x480 OpenGL window and runs until it is stopped.
It has no sound.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]any key\f[R]
quit the intro (closing the window also quits).
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
